ues":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110039","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110039.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110039.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Implements Proposal [#13066](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13066). Any Unicode keys that are available to be used as shortcuts now are displayed as the symbol literal on PopupMenu children of a MenuBar with shortcuts of that key.\r\n\r\nFor testing, I created a [simple project](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22014691/shortcuts-test.zip) to display all the possible shortcuts.\r\n\r\nFor keypad-specific symbols, I chose to match the style of the keypad numbers and label them as \"Kp <symbol>\" so that they are distinct from the normal symbol key. Changing that, or adding/removing any symbols would be as simple as modifying `_shortcut_symbols`.\r\n\r\nVideo of Changes:\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 08-27-2025 05:45:27 PM.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/317ed534-4454-4bdc-822d-fa29038f0555)\r\n\r\nVideo of 4.4.1:\r\n\r\n[Screencast from 08-27-2025 05:46:53 PM.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a68571b4-a733-4710-9bc6-df862185bc25)\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110039/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110039/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}